1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,438
Eleven restaurants, fourteen bars, and a beach where a coral reef keeps the water calm.

2
00:00:05,488 --> 00:00:13,449
That's Barceló Bávaro Palace, a big all-inclusive resort on Bávaro Beach in Punta Cana, in the Dominican Republic.

3
00:00:13,498 --> 00:00:18,714
Here's why it's built for people who hate being bored, and how to get the most out of it.

4
00:00:18,764 --> 00:00:20,010
Start with the beach.

5
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:27,028
It's a private stretch of white sand, and the coral reef helps keep the water calm for swimming and water sports.

6
00:00:27,078 --> 00:00:33,586
Hundreds of guests praise it in their reviews: clean, well kept, with plenty of space.

7
00:00:33,636 --> 00:00:40,089
Back from the sea, there are four outdoor pools, a waterslide, and four poolside bars.

8
00:00:40,139 --> 00:00:44,261
Reviewers say the pools are clean, with plenty to do.

9
00:00:44,311 --> 00:00:45,740
Now, the rooms.

10
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:53,965
There are fourteen hundred and two, all individually furnished, with premium bedding, a separate sitting area, and a balcony.

11
00:00:54,014 --> 00:00:58,463
Some come with a tub right on the terrace, facing the palms.

12
00:00:58,513 --> 00:01:05,523
Premium Level guests can even book every restaurant in advance, with unlimited reservations during their stay.

13
00:01:05,573 --> 00:01:11,754
One guest loved a junior suite in building four, close to both the pool and the beach.

14
00:01:11,805 --> 00:01:13,346
Now, the food and drink.

15
00:01:13,396 --> 00:01:18,427
The hotel lists eleven restaurants: three buffets and eight à la carte.

16
00:01:18,477 --> 00:01:29,420
Think Italian at La Dolce Vita, Mexican at Mexico Lindo, Japanese at Kyoto, French at La Comedie, and a steak house called Santa Fe.

17
00:01:29,470 --> 00:01:33,112
The à la carte dinners run from six to eleven in the evening.

18
00:01:33,163 --> 00:01:41,325
Add fourteen bars, including a lounge for coffee, rum, and cigars near the lobby, open from four until midnight.

19
00:01:41,375 --> 00:01:48,196
And yes, there's a nineteenth hole: Hoyo Diecinueve, a golf bar on the course.

20
00:01:48,247 --> 00:01:51,192
And when you're done eating, there's plenty to do.

21
00:01:51,242 --> 00:02:00,347
There's a bowling alley, tennis courts, a gym with Pilates and fitness classes, and water sports like kayaking, snorkeling, and windsurfing.

22
00:02:00,397 --> 00:02:06,267
The Barcelo U Spa offers massages and body treatments, and reviewers call it a highlight.

23
00:02:06,317 --> 00:02:08,797
The Lakes golf course is about a ten minute walk away.

24
00:02:08,847 --> 00:02:12,667
At night, there's a nightclub, and a casino on site.

25
00:02:12,717 --> 00:02:14,923
A few tips to enjoy it even more.

26
00:02:14,972 --> 00:02:21,816
Book your à la carte dinners once you arrive, since the hotel makes those reservations during your stay, so do it on day one.

27
00:02:21,867 --> 00:02:26,787
Pack long pants and a collared shirt for the evening, because some restaurants have a dress code.

28
00:02:26,837 --> 00:02:34,392
Some guests mention a long wait at check-in, so arrive with a little patience, and speak up early if anything in your room isn't right.

29
00:02:34,442 --> 00:02:39,692
The water park costs extra, and the airport is about twenty minutes away by car.

30
00:02:39,742 --> 00:02:41,260
So, is it worth it?

31
00:02:41,310 --> 00:02:49,348
Guests rate it eight point two out of ten across more than six thousand verified reviews, with cleanliness scoring eight point four.

32
00:02:49,398 --> 00:02:56,909
It's best for couples, friends, and families who want choice: lots of food, lots of bars, and plenty to do.

33
00:02:56,959 --> 00:02:59,238
My honest score: eight out of ten.

34
00:02:59,288 --> 00:03:02,792
That's Barceló Bávaro Palace.
